sel-title = Selectors at work
sel-hint = Click a <em>group</em> to select it. Selecting highlights the paragraphs <em>inside</em> it with a descendant selector (<code>.selected p</code>) and its direct children with a child selector (<code>.selected > p</code>) — watch the nested one: a descendant rule reaches it, a child rule doesn't. <kbd>Space</kbd> / Y switches the language.
sel-group = Group { $label }
sel-direct = A direct paragraph.
sel-nested = A nested paragraph, one level down.
sel-note = Selected: { $selected }
